OL,3,GNEWSABus tour to help people spot
OL,4,Acancer symptoms
OL,5,
OL,6,FA double-decker bus will travel around
OL,7,Fthe West Midlands next month in a
OL,8,Fscheme to help people spot the early
OL,9,Fsigns and symptoms of cancer.
OL,11,FThe service will provide health checks
OL,12,Fand important screening information
OL,13,Fabout the disease, the NHS said.
OL,15,F"Early diagnosis of cancer is vital.
OL,16,FDetecting a problem early on can mean
OL,17,Fthat treatment is more effective", it
OL,18,Fadded.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
