OL,3,GNEWSABus tour to help people spot
OL,4,Acancer symptoms
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the public can first visit
OL,7,Fthe facility in Birmingham on 8
OL,8,FSeptember. The bus will then travel to
OL,9,Fother locations in September, such as
OL,10,FSolihull, Sutton Coldfield, Dudley,
OL,11,FWolverhampton and West Bromwich.
